      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "One source says it was constructed between 892 and 943; Challenger Tours says completed in 905; Art and Architecture of the Middle Ages lists 907. 905 is a midpoint of the commonly cited dates. End is the present: the tomb stands."
